   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "title: \"Minggu 06: Distribusi Khusus Diskrit\"\n",
    "subttle: \"Antrian M/M/1\"\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "# Kuliah 5\n",
    "\n",
    "## Beberapa soal\n",
    "\n",
    "11. **Soal:** Tulis skrip Python untuk menghitung mean dan variansi dari distribusi probabilitas diskrit yang diberikan dalam bentuk dictionary.\n",
    "    - **Solusi:**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "90098a5f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Mean: 2.1, Variance: 0.49\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "dist = {1: 0.2, 2: 0.5, 3: 0.3} # Value: Prob  \n",
    "mean = sum(x * p for x, p in dist.items())  \n",
    "variance = sum((x - mean)**2 * p for x, p in dist.items())  \n",
    "print(f\"Mean: {mean}, Variance: {variance}\")  "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f1a4b792",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "{{<pagebreak}}\n",
    "\n",
    "12. **Soal:** Gunakan `scipy.stats` untuk menghasilkan 1.000 sampel dari variabel acak kustom dan bandingkan rata-rata sampelnya dengan nilai harapan teoretis.\n",
    "    - **Solusi:**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "bac2c637",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Sample Mean: 11.106, Theory Mean: 11.1\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "from scipy.stats import rv_discrete  \n",
    "xk = [10, 11, 12]; pk = [0.2, 0.5, 0.3]  \n",
    "cust_dist = rv_discrete(name='cust', values=(xk, pk))  \n",
    "samples = cust_dist.rvs(size=1000)  \n",
    "print(f\"Sample Mean: {samples.mean()}, Theory Mean: {cust_dist.mean()}\")  "
   ]
  },
